WEBVTT

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:24.460
We sigh whenever we're about to come to a standstill

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:24.460
Owarinaki tabi no tochuu tachidomarisouna toki

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:30.710
While moving on this endless journey.

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:30.710
Fukai tameiki kobosu bokura wa

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:38.430
Everytime we lunge for it, it escapes and flies off.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:38.430
Tsukamikaketewa mata hanareteitta

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:45.850
But now, there's nothing to be afraid of

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:45.850
Demo ima wa mou nanimo osoreru koto wa nai

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:53.780
The powerful ties that bind our hearts

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:53.780
Kokoro wo tsunagu tsuyoi kizuna wa

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:59.240
Will never come loose.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:59.240
Keshite hodoke wa shinai sa

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:08.960
After a lifetime of searching, we finally arrived

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:08.960
Sagashitsuzukete tadoritsuita

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:14.760
Here, where the period lies.

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:14.760
Kono basho de piriodo ni

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:24.060
Let's change all our sorrow and rage to power.

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:24.060
Kanashimi ikari chikara ni kaete

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:28.980
Destiny is right within our reach.

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:28.980
Unmei wa sugu soba ni

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:40.700
Dear!

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.240
Stay back!

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:43.700
Hey...

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:47.000
I think you owe me an explanation, Wrath...!

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.000
My past memories won't disappear...

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:54.250
They're making so much noise inside my head!!

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:56.710
Why are you...

00:01:57.260 --> 00:02:00.010
Why is King Bradley inside of my memories?!

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:02.760
You!!

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:05.220
What did you do to my belongings?!

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:09.730
This is your greed, huh...

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:14.360
You're a fool who craves even his past,
without knowing how to let anything go!

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:17.820
Damn you!

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:05.320
Master!

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:08.490
Madam, Sir Selim, are you two all right as well?!

00:03:08.490 --> 00:03:09.870
Y-Yes...

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.750
We're terribly sorry.

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.420
The guards didn't even stand a chance against him...

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.420
No, worry not.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.550
He was quite powerful.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:19.510
Yes, sir...

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.020
Father,

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:34.980
hurry up and retire.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.860
Olivier...

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:43.650
You come home after such a long time,
and that's the first thing you have to say?

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:49.490
I'm asking you to spend the remainder of your life in peace after naming me the head of the family.

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:53.370
I plan to have Alex succeed the house.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.750
A coward like him?

00:03:56.250 --> 00:04:01.380
Why not transfer all of the family property and go on a long vacation to a foreign country or something?

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:06.590
Alex would be nothing but a hindrance to the Armstrong name.

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:12.640
Sister!

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:14.850
So you were home.

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:17.190
Great timing, Alex.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:17.900
Father?

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:19.900
Duel with Olivier.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:21.190
Pardon?

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:23.690
The victor shall inherit the house.

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:26.570
How does that sound, Olivier?

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:27.620
Perfect.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:28.910
A plausible solution.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:34.460
Olivier told me to retire and to leave the country.

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:35.710
What?!

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:40.540
What an insult to our father!

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:42.960
Very well!

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:53.060
I shall show you what my muscles are capable of.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:56.690
Quite brave of you, Alex!

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:59.060
You'll soon see how inexperienced you truly are!

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:02.610
Well then, shall we get going?

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:03.990
Yes.

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:11.080
So, where should we go for vacation?

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:13.790
How about Xing, Dear?

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:16.710
I hear the food is wonderful there.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.580
Very well, Xing it is.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.250
Are you okay with that, Catherine?

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:22.040
Yes, Father.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.260
W-Wait...

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:35.020
You wish.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:36.890
Are you planning on killing me...?

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:38.310
It took you this  long to notice?!

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:41.520
Good luck, Brother!

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:46.570
What should we get for them as souvenirs?

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:48.450
What about an elephant?

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.320
They're big and strong.

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:52.490
Wow, I'd like one too!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.880
No!!!

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:10.510
It would appear the outcome has been decided.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:21.400
I'm going to inherit everything
owned by the Armstrong family.

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:23.810
Sister...

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:27.820
I hear you've been quite familiar with the upper echelon lately.

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:29.320
Why?!

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.700
Do you not know what they're-

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.450
I plan to see things with my own eyes before making a decision.

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.620
So after you saw their true intentions,

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:40.120
you had the family flee the country in order to keep them safe?

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.840
The defeated should disappear.

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:46.800
This mansion belongs to me now.

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:13.450
Where are you headed, little girl?

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.870
This is the easternmost town.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.120
Even if you keep going, you'll only find a desert.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:22.960
Umm... I was planning on going back to my country.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:23.830
Your country?

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.540
Yes. To Xing.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.250
You're going to cross the desert?

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:28.170
Yes.

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:31.470
A little girl like you is going to cross the desert by herself?

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:32.470
Yes.

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:36.390
Hey guys!

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:37.760
Let's get something together!

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:39.560
Bring out some food and the like!

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:41.350
Huh? But...!

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:42.810
Don't be so restrained!

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:46.060
Why not stay here for the night
and leave for your trip tomorrow?

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:48.070
You can use our bath.

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:49.650
Are you hungry?

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:53.280
Oh yeah, Steve, you've got an extra room at your place, right?

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:54.240
Why don't you let her stay there?

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:55.570
Sure, fine with me.

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:58.080
My eldest daughter's room is open right now.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:00.700
Emmy, who left for the university in Central, right?

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:03.540
She's too perfect to be your daughter.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:04.750
Can't argue with that.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:08.000
We also need to feed this little kitty something.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.550
Oh, my! You must be really hungry!

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:13.920
Are you sure it's not just looking at you  as its next meal?

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:15.340
Don't be stupid!

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:18.010
That's not true, right, Kitty?

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:20.930
See? It's saying that you look tasty!

00:08:25.390 --> 00:08:26.850
Nice people, aren't they?

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:29.320
Are you just going to abandon them?

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:32.440
Well, I guess that's fine.

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:39.870
But I don't think you'll gain anything from
bringing back a half-dead homunculus like me.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:47.170
However, if you go to Central, you'll be able to learn the true method to gain immortality.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:50.250
You may be able to save these people as well.

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:53.130
Oh well.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:57.340
I guess it doesn't mean much to you,
since you're on your way back to your country.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:09.440
Thank you so much for your kindness, everyone!

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:11.360
Where are you going?!

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.230
I still have something I need to take care of!

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:15.150
I'm going back to Central!

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.030
What a moron.

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:21.200
If you go back to Central, the cards will be in my favor.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:26.290
As long as I obtain a philosopher's stone, I can return to my original form.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.290
As long as I obtain one...

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:49.690
What is this place?

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:52.310
It's a hideout we've used before.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:55.030
So this is where your little brother is?

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:55.990
Yeah.

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:58.360
One hundred percent positive.

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:00.320
Al will definitely be here!

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.320
Hey!

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:03.950
There's no one here!

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:03.160
Ow!

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:06.080
You're such an unreliable brother!

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:09.750
So we came all the way down here for nothing?

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:30.140
Lin.

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:31.480
No... is it Greed?

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:36.730
I'm... starving...

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.940
Okay, it's Lin.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.460
Much better!

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:52.460
Thanks for the meal!

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:55.130
You always eat so much, doofus!

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:57.500
So much for our emergency provisions.

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:59.510
Who are those two? Your friends?

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:00.340
Meet Donkey Kong and Li-

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:01.260
My name's Darius!

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:02.590
I'm Heinkel.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:07.260
We used to be in the army, but we're working with this brat right now for various reasons.

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:09.220
Who the hell is he?

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:12.940
Well... how should I explain it...

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.480
I'm a homunculus.

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:15.520
Homun-

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.520
Hey, hey! Why can't you keep your mouth shut?!

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:18.480
Seriously?!

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:20.780
It's a long story, but...

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.740
Hang on, what the hell are you doing here, anyway?

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:27.790
Greed cut all ties with the other homunculi.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:32.500
I took advantage of his restlessness at that point to get my body back from him.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:36.920
I was looking for a place near Central where I could rest,

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:38.130
and I found this shed...

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:40.340
What's wrong?!

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:41.630
This isn't good!

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:43.510
Greed's trying to take over!

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:45.010
Hey!

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:46.930
Hey! Hey! Wait just a second!

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:48.260
Hold out! Don't lose!

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:49.770
Keep your senses!

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.560
Listen up, Ed!

00:11:53.270 --> 00:12:00.900
That 'Father' guy who lurks beneath Central is going to open the gate on "The Day".

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.450
I can only speculate since I'm an amateur at this sort of thing,

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:09.160
but wouldn't you and Al be able to get your bodies back if you two leap into that gate?

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:12.370
No, wait.

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:14.420
That may be true,

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:17.500
but you need to pay a toll to open the gate...

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:22.670
What the hell is he opening the gate for?

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:27.680
Since you said "The Day", does he already know when he's going to open it?

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:28.800
That's...

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:30.310
Lin!

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:31.220
Hey!

00:12:31.970 --> 00:12:32.890
Dammit...

00:12:33.930 --> 00:12:35.440
Don't take over just yet...!

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:38.310
The message...

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:42.990
Did you deliver my message... to Lan Fan?

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.030
"Message"?

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:48.950
Al delivered it to her.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:50.200
Lan Fan is fine.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:52.620
I don't know where she is now, though.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:55.500
Wow, I'm glad to hear...

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:57.290
Lin!

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:59.080
Sorry...

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:02.050
Can't hold out any... longer.

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:11.560
Damn that prince!

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:14.310
Blabbering on and on...!

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.480
Is that you, Greed?

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.390
Yeah, it's me.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:19.650
I wouldn't do that if I were you.

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:22.020
You can't kill me with that.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:24.900
Sorry to disturb you guys.

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:26.700
Hey!

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:29.110
Are you just going to let us go?!

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:30.490
What?

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:34.240
Weren't you listening to what this guy was saying?

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:36.540
I cut ties with the homunculi.

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:41.250
I lost it and attacked Bradley.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:44.340
I don't know what  they'll do to me if I go back.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:48.010
That's why I'm just going to run off
like this and live an easy life.

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:49.380
Alone.

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:52.350
Want to join us?

00:13:55.970 --> 00:13:58.770
If you've got nowhere else to go, then come with us.

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:08.360
Join you...

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:10.360
Join you, eh?

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:11.870
That's funny.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:13.740
Cut the shit!

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:16.500
This entire world belongs to me!

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:21.540
If you  want to work under me , I just might consider it!

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:24.290
Later.

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:35.810
Comrades, huh...

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:41.100
I've got so many souls inside of me...

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:44.190
And yet, I'm... alone.

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:46.860
Then why don't you join up with Ed and them?

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:51.780
If you don't like that, then give me back my body.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:56.370
I'll become the Emperor of Xing and fill up the emptiness in your soul.

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:58.700
An emperor of a country, eh...

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:00.330
Big dream, huh?

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:01.870
You brat!

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:03.130
That's way too small.

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:06.000
If you're going to go that way...

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:11.010
Why don't you strive to become the King of the world?

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.640
King of the world...

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:14.760
Hey, Lin!

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:15.550
Wait up!

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:19.020
What? You guys are so persistent!

00:15:19.220 --> 00:15:20.980
I told you, I'm Greed!

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:24.020
I don't even care which one you are anymore!

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:24.900
Just to make it easier, I'll call you Gredlin!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:25.730
Hey! Who are you calling Gredl-

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:28.400
I'll work under you, Gredlin.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:29.820
What?

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:33.660
I told you, I'll work for you.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:38.290
Which means these two chimeras working with me will be working for you as well.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:39.410
What?!

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:40.620
You brat!

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:42.080
Who gave you permission, anyway?!

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:43.250
Don't get so cocky, you runt!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:45.170
Midget! Flea!

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:56.510
Besides, the moment I decided to become a dog of the military, I threw away all my pride.

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:59.680
At this point, I don't really care if I have to wag my tail.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:00.770
And besides,

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:05.520
it would be dumb to lose this opportunity to get information by having my pride take over.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.150
The chance of a lifetime!

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:11.360
How foolish.

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:15.410
You're going to let your strong feelings take over like that and lose important information?

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.620
Interesting!

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:23.370
Becoming one of my men also means becoming an outcast!

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:24.750
You better not regret it!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.040
Don't take me lightly!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:29.130
I've done far worse than this!

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:31.000
What the hell?

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:32.760
Then it's decided.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:34.880
Then you two are my men as well.

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:37.090
Yeah, sure, whatever.

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:39.760
I don't care who I follow as long as I get to eat.

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:42.020
Just out of curiosity, what kind of chimeras are you?

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:43.100
I'm a gorilla.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:43.640
Lion here.

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:46.350
That's pretty sweet.

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:49.400
I still have her earrings...

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:54.400
Looks like I won't be seeing Winry and Al for a while...

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:58.530
"The Day"... huh.

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:06.330
Seriously, stop coming here all the time!

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:09.180
Dublith

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:09.170
Dublith

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:09.250
I even said I'd let you know when Miss Izumi returns!

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:12.960
If you keep visiting like this, we'll go out of business!

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:18.390
Curtis butcher shop, how can I help you?

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:20.510
Oh, we're always glad to have your business, sir!

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:21.890
The one you ordered, right?

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.430
We'll be back.

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:25.980
Come back as a customer for once, will ya?!

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:31.730
I'm sorry, the soldiers were here again.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.110
